# Run-state cache directory.
#
# At runtime the orchestrator writes one file per research run:
#   <run-id>.json
#
# Each cache file holds sanitized step envelopes plus sanitizer-gate
# completion markers (gate #1 + gate #2) so that an interrupted run can
# resume without re-running already-approved steps.
#
# Schema and lifecycle: see company-research/references/orchestrator.md
# §State persistence.
#
# This .gitkeep exists only so the directory is tracked by git; do not
# put real cache data here.
